# Local Terraform artifacts and potentially sensitive configuration.
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
backend.hcl
*.auto.tfbackend
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# Keep dependency lock files versioned for repeatable example deployments.
